From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tene11 <tene11@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:10:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Choose Cleanroom on the New Instance dialog's Custom page

- Add a "Cleanroom" mod loader choice next to Forge. Its versions come
  from the same GitHub Releases list as the Install Loader dialog, and
  only Minecraft 1.12.2 has any.
- Add Cleanroom::CreationTask: it builds the vanilla instance like
  VanillaCreationTask, then downloads and installs the Cleanroom MMC
  instance zip into it with Cleanroom::InstallTask before the game
  files are downloaded. A new instance has no Forge or other LWJGL 3,
  so none of the Install Loader dialog's questions are needed.
---
